                    </a>

                </nav>

            </div>

        </aside>

        <article class="min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm">

            <div class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/70 px-6 py-7 sm:px-10">

                <div class="flex gap-4">

                    <div class="hidden h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand/10 text-brand sm:flex">
                        <i class="fas fa-store"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div>

                        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
                            Store Terms and Conditions
                        </h2>

                        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-500">
                            Please read these terms carefully before creating or operating
                            a store on the Cococe marketplace.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 lg:px-12">

                <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

                    <section id="section-1" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 pb-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                01
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
                                    About Marketplace Stores
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Our platform operates as a multi-vendor marketplace
                                        that allows approved vendors to create and manage one
                                        or more stores through which products may be offered
                                        to customers.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        A store represents a vendor's commercial presence on
                                        the marketplace. Unless expressly stated otherwise,
                                        the vendor operating the store is responsible for the
                                        products, product information, pricing, inventory,
                                        order fulfillment, warranties, customer service, and
                                        other obligations associated with products sold through
                                        that store.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        The marketplace provides the technology and services
                                        that facilitate transactions between vendors and
                                        customers but does not become the manufacturer, owner,
                                        or supplier of a vendor's products solely by allowing
                                        those products to be listed on the platform.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-2" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                02
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Eligibility to Operate a Store
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        A store may only be operated by a registered and
                                        authorized vendor. Vendors must provide accurate,
                                        complete, and current information requested during
                                        registration, verification, or store creation.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        We may require additional verification before
                                        approving a vendor, activating a store, enabling
                                        certain selling features, or processing vendor
                                        payouts.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors are responsible for maintaining all
                                        registrations, licenses, permits, tax registrations,
                                        or other authorizations required to lawfully conduct
                                        their business.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-3" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                03
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Store Ownership and Management
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Each store must be associated with an approved vendor
                                        account. Vendors are responsible for all activities
                                        performed through their stores and any accounts
                                        authorized to manage those stores.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must keep store information accurate and up
                                        to date, including the store name, description,
                                        contact information, branding, shipping information,
                                        return policies, and other information displayed to
                                        customers.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        A vendor may operate multiple stores where permitted
                                        by the marketplace. We may impose limits on the
                                        number of stores, store categories, or products that
                                        a vendor may maintain.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-4" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                04
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Store Names, Branding, and Identity
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Store names, logos, descriptions, images, and other
                                        branding elements must not be misleading, unlawful,
                                        offensive, deceptive, or infringe the intellectual
                                        property or other rights of third parties.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must not impersonate another business, brand,
                                        organization, individual, or marketplace store.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        We may reject, modify, restrict, or require the
                                        removal of store branding that violates these terms
                                        or creates a risk of customer confusion, fraud,
                                        infringement, or abuse.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-5" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                05
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Product Listings
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors are responsible for ensuring that all product
                                        listings are accurate, lawful, and sufficiently
                                        detailed for customers to make informed purchasing
                                        decisions.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Product listings should accurately describe relevant
                                        characteristics, including where applicable:
                                    </p>

                                    <ul class="space-y-2 pl-5">

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Product name and brand
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Product description and specifications
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Available variants, colors, sizes, or configurations
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Product condition
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Price and applicable charges
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Inventory availability
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Product images
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Warranty information
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Delivery or shipping information
                                        </li>

                                        <li class="relative pl-2">
                                            Other information required by applicable law
                                            or marketplace policy
                                        </li>

                                    </ul>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must not use false specifications, misleading
                                        images, inaccurate availability information, deceptive
                                        discounts, fake reviews, or other practices intended
                                        to mislead customers.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-6" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                06
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Product Authenticity and Quality
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors may only offer products they are legally
                                        entitled to sell. Products must comply with applicable
                                        quality, safety, labeling, certification, and consumer
                                        protection requirements.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Counterfeit, pirated, stolen, illegally imported,
                                        unsafe, recalled, or otherwise unlawful products are
                                        prohibited.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        We may request documentation demonstrating the
                                        authenticity, origin, authorization, certification,
                                        or legal sale of a product.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-7" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                07
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Pricing
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors are generally responsible for setting the
                                        prices of products offered through their stores,
                                        subject to marketplace rules and applicable law.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Prices must be displayed accurately and must not
                                        involve artificial inflation, deceptive reference
                                        pricing, misleading discounts, hidden mandatory
                                        charges, or other unfair pricing practices.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Where taxes, shipping charges, service fees, or other
                                        amounts apply, these may be displayed separately as
                                        permitted by the marketplace checkout process and
                                        applicable law.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-8" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                08
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Inventory and Availability
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors are responsible for maintaining accurate
                                        inventory information. Products should not be presented
                                        as available where the vendor knows or reasonably
                                        should know that the products cannot be fulfilled.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Repeated cancellations caused by inaccurate stock
                                        information may result in reduced store visibility,
                                        selling restrictions, temporary suspension, or other
                                        marketplace action.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-9" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                09
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Orders and Fulfillment
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        When a customer places a valid order, the vendor is
                                        responsible for processing and fulfilling that order
                                        within the applicable handling and delivery periods.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must package products appropriately, provide
                                        accurate shipping information where applicable, and
                                        use reasonable efforts to ensure products reach
                                        customers safely and within the communicated delivery
                                        period.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must not request that customers complete
                                        marketplace orders outside the platform where doing
                                        so is intended to avoid marketplace fees, customer
                                        protections, transaction monitoring, or other
                                        platform requirements.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-10" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                10
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Order Cancellations
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors should avoid cancelling confirmed orders
                                        except where cancellation is reasonably necessary,
                                        such as because of inventory errors, suspected fraud,
                                        product safety concerns, or other legitimate
                                        circumstances.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        We may monitor vendor cancellation rates and take
                                        appropriate action where repeated cancellations
                                        negatively affect customers or marketplace reliability.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-11" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                11
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Returns, Refunds, and Customer Claims
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must comply with the marketplace return and
                                        refund policies as well as any mandatory customer
                                        rights provided under applicable law.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors are responsible for responding promptly and
                                        reasonably to claims involving defective products,
                                        incorrect products, damaged products, missing items,
                                        authenticity concerns, warranty claims, delivery
                                        problems, and other order-related issues.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Where marketplace dispute-resolution procedures apply,
                                        vendors agree to cooperate with those procedures and
                                        provide requested evidence within the applicable
                                        deadlines.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-12" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                12
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

                                <h2 class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                                    Customer Communication
                                </h2>

                                <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-600">

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must communicate with customers professionally
                                        and only for legitimate purposes related to marketplace
                                        transactions, customer support, or other permitted
                                        activities.
                                    </p>

                                    <p>
                                        Vendors must not use customer information for
                                        unsolicited marketing, harassment, fraud, data
                                        harvesting, or purposes unrelated to the customer's
                                        interaction with the marketplace.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </section>

                    <section id="section-13" class="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-gray-100 py-8">

                        <div class="flex gap-4">

                            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">
                                13
                            </span>

                            <div class="flex-1">

